# jttrack and jtroadf: input issue

- Source URL: https://github.com/jotego/jtcores/issues/1302

Hi, i realized a strange issue within Track & Field and Hyper Sports in jttrack (v856edaf, Mister v250828).

Both games use the stick and buttons 1-3. When pushing the stick left/right too fast, button 2 is triggered.

How to reproduce: track&field long jump, Hyper Sports swimming: push stick left/right real fast and it will automatically trigger button 2. In long jump he will start jumping way to early, in swimming he will breath also too early. If you push left/right with medium speed everything runs fine.

Verified on two independant Misters, one with usb joystick, one with jamma adapter. The issue exists for player 1 and 2.
The games did run fine some time ago (maybe 1-2 years ago).

If helpful I can try to add a video of the problem.

